  "content": "\n\n<h1>額外紅石</h1>\n<h4>為紅石機制增添更多內容</h4>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/v31Shw5/divider-red.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"20\" /></p>\n\n目前新增的邏輯閘：\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/dfmw4qS/basic-gates.png\" alt=\"邏輯閘\" width=\"579\" height=\"450\" /></p>\n<p>其他方塊：</p>\n\n<p>\n    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rFM76WB/sequencer.gif\" alt=\"序列器\" width=\"250\" height=\"188\" />\n    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/GtWWc3F/oscillator.gif\" alt=\"震盪器\" width=\"250\" height=\"188\" />\n    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fXJ8cbD/t-flip-flop.gif\" alt=\"T型觸發器\" width=\"250\" height=\"188\" />\n</p>\n\n<p>\n    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/WHvSx50/toggle-latch.gif\" alt=\"切換鎖存器\" width=\"250\" height=\"188\" />\n    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/vzjMCQc/timer.gif\" alt=\"計時器\" width=\"250\" height=\"188\" />\n</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/v31Shw5/divider-red.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"20\" /></p>\n\n合成配方請見&nbsp;\n    <a title=\"合成配方\" href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/AdditionalRedstone/wiki/Recipes\" target=\"_blank\"\n        rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">此處</a>\n</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/v31Shw5/divider-red.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1903\" height=\"20\" /></p>\n\n如果您對本模組有任何問題，或想了解即將推出的功能：\n<br>\n歡迎加入 Discord&nbsp;&nbsp;\n    <a title=\"Discord\" href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n        <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VQ66pHN/Discord.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\" />\n    </a>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;\n    <a title=\"Discord\" href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">連結</a>",
